  },
  "body": "Hi! While using the skill I noticed the temp folder kept growing, which matches the 60+ GB issue mentioned in the Gotchas. `bridge-stills.mjs` bundles once per run but never deletes the bundle, so every stills check leaves ~1.3 GB behind.\n\nWhat I changed:\n- `bridge-stills.mjs` now deletes its bundle when it's done (also if a render fails), and prints a warning if old leftovers go over 5 GB\n- added `clean-remotion-temp.mjs` to clean up old leftovers (dry run by default, `--yes` to delete)\n- small notes in README and SKILL.md (step 11 asks the user before deleting, same as the Gotchas rule)\n\nI tested it with a minimal Remotion project and a 300 MB `public/` folder, 3 runs each:\n\n| Run | Before | After |\n|-----|--------|-------|\n| 1 | 0.33 GB | 0 GB |\n| 2 | 0.65 GB | 0 GB |\n| 3 | 0.98 GB | 0 GB |\n\nStills still render the same, and the bundle is also removed when a render fails.\n\nUnrelated, but the Chrome path is hardcoded to `C:/Program Files/...`, which doesn't work with a per-user install. I can open another PR for that if you want.\n\nThanks for sharing the skill!",
